{% comment %}
  International SEO: hreflang cluster between the UK store (drivecustom.co.uk)
  and the French sister store (les-as-du-volant.com).
  Handles differ between the two stores, so equivalent pages are mapped
  explicitly below (source of truth: hreflang-map.csv, mirrored in the FR
  theme's snippets/hreflang.liquid — the two files MUST stay symmetric or
  Google drops the whole cluster).
  x-default points to the FR page (primary market).
  Pages without a mapped equivalent emit nothing: wrong hreflang is worse
  than none. When adding a product/collection that exists on both stores,
  add its pair here AND in the FR snippet.
{% endcomment %}
